  "headline": "MPR Consults Experts On Mechanism For Selecting Vice President",
  "seoTitle": "MPR Discusses Vice President Election Process",
  "metaDescription": "The MPR Ad Hoc Committee is preparing the selection process for a new vice president after President Prabowo submitted two official candidates.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The MPR Ad Hoc Committee has begun discussions on the formal mechanism for electing a new vice president.",
    "Experts are scheduled to be consulted by the committee during an upcoming meeting to refine the selection process.",
    "President Prabowo recently submitted the names of two candidates, Sugiono and Amran, to the MPR for consideration."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The MPR Ad Hoc Committee is currently working to establish a clear framework for the selection of a new vice president. This follows the formal submission of two candidates, Sugiono and Amran, by President Prabowo to the MPR. The process has been marked by internal debate within the MPR regarding the consistency of the election rules, leading officials to emphasize the need for a formal and coherent mechanism. As part of these preparations, the committee is setting up a working team to oversee the eventual inauguration of the successful candidate. A meeting is planned for December 11 to further address these procedural requirements. The committee intends to invite subject matter experts to provide input on the appointment mechanism to ensure the selection process adheres to established legislative standards and requirements.",
